    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unveil the Secrets of Catherine Markwell in Violet: A Prelude to TRAUMA Broken Paradise</h2><br><strong>THIS IS NOT A WALKING SIMULATOR GAME</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfadWhat is Psychological Survival Horror?]\ud83e\ude78</h2><br><strong>\ud83c\udfad Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 A subgenre of horror that focuses on <strong>the player\u2019s mind</strong>, creating fear through tension, atmosphere, and storytelling. Instead of relying on direct jump scares, it explores deep themes like <strong>paranoia, insanity, and the unknown</strong>, making the player question reality within the game.<br><br><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Survival Horror</strong> \u2013 A genre centered on <strong>surviving against terror</strong>, where resources are limited, and every decision matters. The player must face terrifying threats, either through combat or specific mechanics to fight back. Fear comes not only from the enemies but also from the character\u2019s <strong>vulnerability and constant tension</strong>.<br><br>Both genres can blend, creating unique experiences where the player not only survives but also feels the <strong>psychological weight of horror</strong>. \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f  <br><br><strong>The Markwell Legacy Awaits:</strong>  <br>Travel 20 years before the harrowing events of TRAUMA Broken Paradise and immerse yourself in the shadowed past of Catherine Markwell. Her role in Siren's Well's dark tale is one you must unravel. \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Prelude to a Silent Nightmare:</h2>  <br>Experience the eerie stillness that precedes the calamity of TRAUMA Broken Paradise. Guide Catherine through an unsettling journey where every corner hides an enigma, and every moment tests your perception. \ud83c\udf19<br><br><u>Explore Through Four Unique Perspectives:</u><br><br><strong>Catherine Markwell's Journey</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/21dbac2fa4a3a01dc5075c770b2d6012.poster.avif?t=1741093224\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/21dbac2fa4a3a01dc5075c770b2d6012.webm?t=1741093224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/21dbac2fa4a3a01dc5075c770b2d6012.mp4?t=1741093224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Daniella Markwell's Fate</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/2992ede7b0d27170deca49e79c0706b4.poster.avif?t=1741093224\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/2992ede7b0d27170deca49e79c0706b4.webm?t=1741093224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/2992ede7b0d27170deca49e79c0706b4.mp4?t=1741093224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Hisoka Ayumi's Enigma</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/c5eab6f1723f31fdcd2090f59c4ec4fc.poster.avif?t=1741093224\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/c5eab6f1723f31fdcd2090f59c4ec4fc.webm?t=1741093224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/c5eab6f1723f31fdcd2090f59c4ec4fc.mp4?t=1741093224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Fumihiro Akio's Plight</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/fa97796e73c0739c5dbc3ce16b064967.poster.avif?t=1741093224\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/fa97796e73c0739c5dbc3ce16b064967.webm?t=1741093224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/fa97796e73c0739c5dbc3ce16b064967.mp4?t=1741093224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse Yourself in a Psychological Thriller:</h2>  <br>In Violet, tension builds not through cheap jumpscares but through a calculated atmosphere where silence is as terrifying as the unknown. The world of Siren's Well is not one of fast-paced action but of eerie exploration, where the real horror lies in the quiet, oppressive weight of the past\u2014and the puzzles that guard its secrets. \ud83d\udd0d<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock the Dark Mysteries of the Past:</h2>  <br>Inspired by the best of psychological horror, <i>Violet</i> offers a maze of riddles and hidden truths. Delve into a labyrinth of lore, where each discovery brings you closer to understanding the cursed legacy of the Markwell family. \ud83d\udcdc<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive Through Wit and Will:</h2>  <br>Solve intricate puzzles, gather vital resources, and outsmart the horrors that linger in the shadows. In Violet, your mind is your greatest weapon, as you navigate the mysteries of Siren's Well and uncover its darkest corners. \ud83e\udde0<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Path and Unravel the Fate of Catherine:</h2>  <br>With 7 possible endings and over 20 unlockable outfits, every choice matters. But the true question is: can you solve the riddles in time to escape the fate that awaits? \ud83d\udc57<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/0f157c083d44b200780ca226cc1e8dc0.poster.avif?t=1741093224\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/0f157c083d44b200780ca226cc1e8dc0.webm?t=1741093224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584290/extras/0f157c083d44b200780ca226cc1e8dc0.mp4?t=1741093224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Journey for True Horror Enthusiasts:</h2>  <br>Violet is crafted with the love of classic survival horror, offering an experience that challenges not just your reflexes, but your intellect. This is a game for those who seek to unravel the quiet terror of a carefully crafted world. \ud83d\udc80<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Descent Begins Now:</h2>  <br>Are you ready to face the calm dread that hides beneath the surface of Siren's Well? In Violet, there\u2019s no rush, but the secrets you uncover may be the only way to survive the nightmare yet to come. \ud83d\udd73\ufe0f",
